# Simplo — Cursor Rules

## Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, Prisma, NextAuth

## Conventions
- Server Components by default; use "use client" only when needed
- API routes under app/api; always check session + role
- Role helpers live in lib/utils.ts (canCreateProject, canManageDrawing, canCheckProgress, canManageUsers)
- Keep UI consistent: slate palette, rounded-xl cards, shared Button/Input/Modal

## Role access (Fase 1)
- ADMIN/PM: create project, upload drawing, plot marker, isi breakdown
- SM/LEADER: centang progress only
- ADMIN only: kelola user
- Semua role: lihat progress

## Fase scope
- Fase 1: Auth, Project CRUD, Floor/drawing, Marker, Breakdown, Progress, Dashboard
- Fase 2 (jangan kerjakan kecuali diminta): Cost, Inventory, Absen, Pekerja, Notifikasi, Blocker
